    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Compare branching versus single-line models using genomic and morphological phylogenies of living and fossil hominids and apes. Robust non-ladder topology and incompatible transformation trajectories support divergent variation.";
